{"page_id": "synth_copies-images_sva4282ce4-p1", "markdown": "# 第10 ※ 对文件的输入输出 （343\n\n（1）从键盘读入n个字符串，存放在一个二维字符数组中，每个一维数组存放一个\n\n字符串；\n\n（2） 对字符数组中钓，个字符串按字母顺字排序，排好序的字符串仍存放在字符数\n\n组中；\n\n（3）将字符数组中前字符串顺序输出。\n\n编写程序：\n\n# include ‹stdio. h>\n\n# include <stdlib. h>\n\n# include ‹string. h> int main)\n\n{ FILE * fp;\n\nchar str［3］［10］，temp［10］：\n\nint i,j,k,n-3;\n\nprintf（\"Enter strings:n™）：\n\nfor（1=0;i＜n;1++）\n\ngets(str i]);\n\nNIstr是用来存放字符串約二维数組，temp 是临时数组\n\n1提示输入字符串\n\n1/翰入宇符串\n\nfor(i-0;i<n-1;i++)\n\n{k=i;\n\nfor(j=i+1¿¿ n¿j++)\n\nif(strcmp(str[k],str[j])>0) k-j;\n\nif(k!=i)\n\n{strcpy(temp.str[i]):\n\nstrepy(str[i],str[k]);\n\nstrepy(str[k],temp);\n\n1用选择法对字符串排字\n\niff(fp=fopen(\"D:|CCi|string. dat\",\"w\"))==NULL)\n\nprintf(\"can't open file!\\n\");\n\nexit(O);\n\nprintf(\"nThe new sequence:'n\");\n\nfor(i=0;i<n;i++)\n\n(fputs(str(i],fp); fputs(\" n\", fp); printf(®%s\\n\",str[i]);\n\nreturn 0;\n\n1打开磁盘文件\n\n！向诺盘文件写一个字符出、然后输出一个换行符 //在屏幕上县示\n\n运行结果：\n\nEnter strings:\n\nCANADA INDIA\n\nCHINA INDIA", "width": 1654, "height": 2340, "blocks": [{"kind": "heading", "text": "第10 ※ 对文件的输入输出 （343", "bbox": {"x": 1063.8184650368974, "y": 181.5447346953551, "width": 475.7297992481905, "height": 78.83296716213216}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "（1）从键盘读入n个字符串，存放在一个二维字符数组中，每个一维数组存放一个", "bbox": {"x": 277.28823507420634, "y": 302.2499999899829, "width": 1177.2588235294118, "height": 43.87500000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "字符串；", "bbox": {"x": 194.5388538077703, "y": 350.8676916936988, "width": 116.85170355404122, "height": 44.1396163702011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "（2） 对字符数组中钓，个字符串按字母顺字排序，排好序的字符串仍存放在字符数", "bbox": {"x": 267.55882328819496, "y": 399.7499999898859, "width": 1182.1235294117648, "height": 48.750000000000085}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "组中；", "bbox": {"x": 189.7235290936878, "y": 448.49999983124985, "width": 92.42941176470585, "height": 43.87500000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "（3）将字符数组中前字符串顺序输出。", "bbox": {"x": 272.4235291595207, "y": 497.2499999819445,